sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant SenderApp as Sender App
    participant Gateway as Realtime Gateway
    participant DB as PostgreSQL DB
    participant RecipientApp as Recipient App (Offline -> Online)

    SenderApp->>Gateway: Send Message Envelope
    Gateway->>DB: Store Envelope (State: PENDING_DELIVERY)
    Note over RecipientApp: Recipient Device Disconnected (Offline)
    Gateway-->>SenderApp: Server Receipt ACK (Sent State)
    Note over RecipientApp: Recipient Device Connects (Online)
    RecipientApp->>Gateway: WSS Handshake & Authenticate
    Gateway->>DB: Fetch Undelivered Envelopes for Device
    Gateway->>RecipientApp: Flush Pending Envelopes Batch
    RecipientApp-->>Gateway: ACK Batch Received
    Gateway->>DB: Update State to DELIVERED
